{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111811","id":2927381324,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ufEtM","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111811","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111811.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111811.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111811","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111811/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111811/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111811/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/75446fc4d0acbd1822b4add71ecfb901015fcfad","number":111811,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix switch to GameView when closing game window","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- *Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110840*\r\n\r\n## Issue Description\r\n\r\nGodot added a function to jump to GameView for debugging at Dec 30, 2024.\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100916\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100902\r\n\r\nThis feature add a timer into `embedded_process` to watch whether the `EDITOR_GAME` focused. This time will be triggered each `0.1 second`.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7864ac80192e9e91bf56176af9f04cc013b580aa/editor/run/game_view_plugin.cpp#L497-L501\r\n\r\nIt will switch to `EDITOR_GAME` when `get_window_enabled() == false`.\r\n\r\nWhen we close testing game window, it will trigger `_window_close_request()`.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7864ac80192e9e91bf56176af9f04cc013b580aa/editor/run/game_view_plugin.cpp#L1071-L1092\r\n\r\nAt first, we invoke `set_window_enabled(false)`, then consider to invoke `embedded_process.reset()`. Unfortunately, when the condition doesnot match, e.g. `is_embedding_completed`, we wont `reset` `embedded_process` immediately. That  makes the timer keep alive for a short time.\r\n\r\nIf the timer success trigger a signal in that short time, it will find `get_window_enabled()` is false, and control editor switch to `EDITOR_GAME`. \r\n\r\nSo, invoke `reset()` before `set_enabled(false)` can solve this issue.\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels